# Private research/source materials -- literature PDFs, internal research
# summaries, and any other local-only documents. Never tracked, regardless
# of what subfolder structure gets added under here later.
Source/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Segmentation/ (root/segmentation phase, moved into its own top-level
# folder 2026-07-29). Patterns below are anchored to wherever this
# .gitignore file lives (git treats any pattern containing a "/" in the
# middle as anchored to the .gitignore's own directory, not matched at any
# depth) -- so they need the Segmentation/ prefix explicitly, or the
# large binaries they're meant to exclude would silently become
# trackable again after the move. Single-segment patterns (no "/" in the
# middle, e.g. archive.zip, venv/, __pycache__/) match at any depth
# regardless and did not need changing.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw dataset archive
archive.zip
dataset anemia/

# Locally-kept full-output backups of the notebooks/*_full_visual_audit.ipynb
# review notebooks (each 90MB+ once actually run, with embedded per-patient
# image overlays) -- the tracked notebook files themselves are always kept
# output-stripped/clean; these backups exist purely so a personal review run
# isn't lost, and must never be swept into a commit.
Segmentation/notebooks/*_executed_backup.ipynb

# Processed image/mask outputs (large binaries, regenerable from archive.zip)
Segmentation/data/processed/images/
Segmentation/data/processed/masks/

# Raw-photo-aligned image/mask outputs (large binaries, regenerable via
# Segmentation/scripts/build_aligned_dataset.py; alignment_log.csv is NOT
# ignored -- it's small and worth keeping in version control)
Segmentation/data/processed/aligned_raw/images/
Segmentation/data/processed/aligned_raw/masks/

# Same, for the forniceal_palpebral tissue-type variant
# (Segmentation/scripts/build_aligned_dataset_forniceal.py)
Segmentation/data/processed/aligned_raw_forniceal/images/
Segmentation/data/processed/aligned_raw_forniceal/masks/

# Orphaned local output from the abandoned Phase 3 crop-based approach
# (its generating scripts were deleted; this directory is stale disk
# clutter, kept ignored purely so it can't be accidentally committed)
Segmentation/data/cropped/

# Python virtual environment
venv/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local backups / Kaggle upload-prep artifacts (left at repo root, not
# moved into Segmentation/ -- they're stale pre-reorg directory snapshots)
clean_map.txt
folder_map.txt
folder_map_utf8.txt
Segmentation/data/processed/eyes_processed_data.zip
Segmentation/data/processed/aligned_raw.zip
Segmentation/data/processed/aligned_raw_forniceal.zip

# Trained model checkpoints (large binaries, regenerable by retraining;
# outputs/logs/ metrics CSV/JSON are NOT ignored -- those are small and
# worth keeping in version control)
Segmentation/outputs/checkpoints/
